    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3e10c96b-3205-5231-a7c2-6152dc486fd9" activityNameId="6ac3ce0c-58f2-5be7-8f12-b2832ac71059" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Dioxane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Dioxane, at plant
The process "1,4-dioxane, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of 1,4-dioxane  from diethylene glycol in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000123-91-1; 
Formula: C4H8O2; 
Synonyms: diethylene dioxide, diethylene ether, 1,4-dioxacyclohexane, dioxyethylene ether; 
UUID: 0d6733a9-020a-38c5-9c55-2ae16c0df66c
Production of 1,4-dioxane including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Dehydration of diethylene gylcol
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0d6733a9-020a-38c5-9c55-2ae16c0df66c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
